{title: Tinka Tinka Zara Zara}
{artist: Alisha Chinai Vishal Shekhar}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m],        tinka tinka jara jara,
[Fm] [A#m],        Hai roshnee se jaise bhara
[A#m],        tinka tinka jara jara,
[Fm] [A#m],        Hai roshnee se jaise bhara
[F#] [G#] [A#m],        Har dil mai arman hote toh hai
[F#] [G#] [A#m],        Har dil mai arman hote toh hai
[G#] [F#] [A#m],        Bas koyee samjhe jara
[Fm] [G#] [Fm] [A#m],        Dil pe ek naya sa nasha chha gaya
[Fm] [G#] [Fm] [A#m],        Kho raha tha jo khwab woh laut aa gaya
[A#m] [Fm],        Yeh jo ehsas hai jo karar hai,
[A#m] [Fm],        Kya isee kaa hee nam pyar hai
[G#] [F#] [A#m],        Puchhe dil thumke jara
